# Generated placeholder demo/dev imagery — see scripts/generate-placeholder-assets.mjs
# (runs automatically via prebuild/predev). The repo's pre-commit hook blocks
# committing .jpg/.png/.webp, and per project policy generated media is never
# committed anyway. Real merchants override by placing their own assets at
# these exact paths.
